{"study_accession":"PRJNA783047","secondary_study_accession":"SRP347513","title":"Identification of genes associated with bortezomib-based treatment in multiple myeloma patients through bone marrow single-cell RNA-Seq","description":"In this study, we performed scRNA-seq analyses of bone marrow mononuclear cells (BM-MNCs) in patients with MM receiving bortezomib-based treatments to investigate following questions; (i) the compositional differences in BM-MNCs between normal control and MM patients, and between good and poor responder groups, and (ii) the genes and the cell-to-cell communication networks associated with the treatment responsiveness. Overall design: For scRNA-seq, we used baseline bone marrow aspirates (treatment-naïve) from 18 MMs, who treated with bortezomib-melphalan-prednisolone. The single-cell library preparation relied on a commercially available droplet method using the 10x Genomic Chromium System and Single Cell 3' v3 Reagent Kit according to the manufacturer’s protocol.","pubmed":"36380017","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"study_labels":[{"level":"study","event_code":"STEROID_START","certainty":"confirmed","delta_days":-60.0,"delta_bucket":"B_FAR","time_precision":"approx","stage":"teacher","confidence":1.0,"evidence":"Overall design: For scRNA-seq, we used baseline bone marrow aspirates (treatment-naïve) from 18 MMs, who treated with bortezomib-melphalan-prednisolone.","model_version":"teacher:mlx:mlx-community/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct-4bit"}],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN23415404","study_accession":"PRJNA783047","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"MM023","description":"MM023","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5702264","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-11-12","attributes":[["source_name","bone marrow mononuclear cells"],["treatment","bortezomib-melphalan-prednisolone"],["tissue","Bone marrow"],["disease","Multiple myeloma"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR17022241","experiment_accession":"SRX13213179",